          "text": "MI Wan-chung 米萬鍾 (T. 仲詔, H. 友石), painter, a chin-shih of 1595, was a native of Wan-p'ing (Peking). His father, Mi Yü 米玉 (T. 崑泉, 1528–1597), held an hereditary post in the Imperial Bodyguard of the Ming Court.",
